B.aaL=new A.io(B.m3,"Watch Videos","Watch Videos","The more time you spend here, the more you'll earn. Users from high-CPM countries can earn up to 3x more per video. Just watch whatever videos, movies, or shorts are available \u2014 every view adds to your balance.\n\nTip: keep the app open and let videos play back-to-back for maximum earnings.","Jitna zyada waqt is per lagayenge, utni zyada earning hogi. High-CPM countries ke users ko per video 3x tak zyada milta hai. Bas jo bhi videos, movies ya shorts available hain unhe dekhte rahen \u2014 har view aapke balance mein add hota hai.\n\nTip: App ko open rakhein aur videos ko lagataar chalne dein taake earning maximum ho.",null,null)
B.aaI=new A.io(B.qU,"Daily Bonus","Daily Bonus","Log in every single day to claim your Daily Bonus \u2014 it's free extra coins just for showing up. The longer your daily streak, the bigger your reward gets. Don't miss a day, or your streak resets!","Har roz login karke apna Daily Bonus zaroor collect karein \u2014 sirf app kholne par free coins milte hain. Jitni lambi streak hogi, utna zyada reward milega. Ek din bhi miss na karein, warna streak reset ho jayegi!",null,null)
